{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Introduction:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Soul Astray\u00a0</strong>is a contemplative retro-style platformer that intentionally uproots one of the genre's key assumptions: input consistency! Refresh your expectations as you master the unique challenges introduced by the &quot;Control Switch&quot; mechanic (explained below) in a world filled with groovy music.\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Game Mechanic:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Control Switch Mechanic</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Dash&quot; and &quot;Jump&quot; inputs switch with each jump!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your character's color provides a visual cue for the input orientation.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3760080/extras/fdadfd722445e2df716f5b2323fc3fe8.poster.avif?t=1768570630\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3760080/extras/fdadfd722445e2df716f5b2323fc3fe8.webm?t=1768570630\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3760080/extras/fdadfd722445e2df716f5b2323fc3fe8.mp4?t=1768570630\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Other Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Foresight: </strong>Use the game's <i>Foresight</i> mechanic to plan your route to achieve the unlikely first-try success.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Difficulty:\u00a0</strong>A minimal tutorial followed by learn-as-you-fail levels that demand creativity.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Health Tokens: </strong>You're an immortal soul that can survive without health, but the tokens might be useful elsewhere...</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Redemption Tokens: </strong>If you find yourself stuck due to an earlier misstep, use these limited tokens to restart the level.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Goodness Meter:</strong> The purity of your soul is tracked, show them (who?) that you have more than just a good heart.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Lamps: </strong>Sacrifice soul fragments to light the lamps in your path, a gift to help guide other lost souls. If you find a lamp already lit, accept the gift for a unique power.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Trinkets:</strong> Collect trinkets in hard-to-reach places to remind yourself who you are + alter game outcomes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Secrets: </strong>Unexpected secrets encourage you to make choices that can alter your end-goal.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Story:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A gently implied story of struggling to find direction. Your hesitancy to commit to a path in life has left you abandoned. Work through your indecision as you constantly transition between good and evil to find yourself!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3760080/extras/22c1d05ca152fa39eda6a7b622293591.poster.avif?t=1768570630\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3760080/extras/22c1d05ca152fa39eda6a7b622293591.webm?t=1768570630\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3760080/extras/22c1d05ca152fa39eda6a7b622293591.mp4?t=1768570630\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You watch them ascend around you... Can you keep up?</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Taoist","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3760080/f50bcc0f7a778d66c25ee0b9142d16b6e18415cb.jpg"},{"name":"Hedonist","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3760080/178c3da4db7c88f42a6caa7ee7f2a52fc1a40dd8.jpg"},{"name":"Atheist","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3760080/b1905b1f6862e473f2536f2ee458e0217442003d.jpg"},{"name":"Buddhist","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3760080/1f262278421a160e6afbc08f5ddfecd637e61f32.jpg"},{"name":"Christian","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3760080/3d735ea370a578c2301000fa89eb7ffebec12508.jpg"},{"name":"Devout","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3760080/89785f0fa9589203e698ba5a459af46e7fff82cf.jpg"},{"name":"Horder","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3760080/e1426d17b2c67cb1ebb8af0eb2d4d495acc6938b.jpg"},{"name":"Beginning to Believe","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3760080/29c2623444b6648120f52379dab38e50180b1f25.jpg"},{"name":"Good Samaritan","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3760080/cb7239e717fe07ee246484ccc05571320f61c5a8.jpg"},{"name":"Better Samaritan","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3760080/11c5e4ef30cab01d3297dd980318f4b0c0ac37de.jpg"}],"total":14},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3760080?t=1768570630","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3760080/2cc47161c59b0e23ec07104ba832d56ca22f1901/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1768570630","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3760080/9e8d160eaa6c2084f6b8764918e516ce97b1e9e0/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1768570630","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3760080/9e8d160