ght</i> mechanic to plan your route to achieve the unlikely first-try success.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Difficulty:\u00a0</strong>A minimal tutorial followed by learn-as-you-fail levels that demand creativity.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Health Tokens: </strong>You're an immortal soul that can survive without health, but the tokens might be useful elsewhere...</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Redemption Tokens: </strong>If you find yourself stuck due to an earlier misstep, use these limited tokens to restart the level.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Goodness Meter:</strong> The purity of your soul is tracked, show them (who?) that you have more than just a good heart.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Lamps: </strong>Sacrifice soul fragments to light the lamps in your path, a gift to help guide other lost souls. If you find a lamp already lit, accept the gift for a unique power.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Trinkets:</strong> Collect trinkets in hard-to-reach places to remind yourself who you are + alter game outcomes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Secrets: </strong>Unexpected secrets encourage you to make choices that can alter your end-goal.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Story:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A gently implied story of struggling to find direction. Your hesitancy to commit to a path in life has left you abandoned. Work through your indecision as you constantly transition between good and evil to find yourself!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3760080/extras/22c1d05ca152fa39eda6a7b622293591.poster.avif?t=1768570630\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3760080/extras/22c1d05ca152fa39eda6a7b622293591.webm?t=176